  <section class="lab"><header class="heading"><p class="eyebrow">苏科版 · 八年级{{m.chapter.term==='upper'?'上册':'下册'}} / 第{{m.chapter.number}}章 {{m.chapter.title}}</p><h2>{{m.title}}</h2><p>{{m.current.goal}}</p></header><div class="workspace"><section class="observation"><div class="scene-card"><div class="scene-head"><span>LIVE / 动态观察</span><span>{{m.running?'循环改变：'+m.current.controls.find(c=>c.key===m.animateKey)?.label:'手动探索'}}</span></div><svg id="scene" viewBox="0 0 720 360" role="img" :aria-label="m.title"><title>{{m.title}}</title><defs><clipPath id="plot-clip"><rect x="60" y="55" width="600" height="255"/></clipPath></defs><g v-html="m.svg"/></svg><div class="playback"><Button class="primary" :aria-pressed="m.running" @click="a.play">{{m.running?'暂停':'▶ 播放变化'}}</Button><Button @click="a.step(1)">单步 →</Button><label>速度 <Button @click="open('speed')">{{m.speed}}× ⌄</Button></label></div></div><div class="stats"><div v-for="([label,value],i) in m.stats" :key="i" class="stat"><span>{{label}}</span><strong>{{value}}</strong></div></div><section class="conclusion"><h3>观察与解释</h3><p :aria-live="m.running?'off':'polite'">{{m.conclusion}}</p></section></section><aside class="parameters"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EXPERIMENT</p><h3>动手调一调</h3><p class="control-hint">滑动参数立即更新图形和数值。播放时循环改变下方选中的参数。</p><div v-for="control in m.current.controls" :key="control.key" class="control"><label>{{control.label}}<output>{{m.values[control.key]}}</output></label><Slider :aria-label="control.label" :model-value="m.values[control.key]" :min="control.min" :max="control.max" :step="control.step" @update:model-value="value=>a.adjust(control.key,value)" @keydown="sliderKey($event,control)"/></div><label class="animate-label">播放时改变<Button block @click="open('animate')">{{m.current.controls.find(c=>c.key===m.animateKey)?.label}} ⌄</Button></label><div class="actions"><Button @click="a.reset">重置</Button><Button @click="a.random">随机条件</Button></div></section><section v-if="!m.quizHidden" class="card quiz"><div class="card-heading"><h3>预测小测</h3><Button icon="cross" aria-label="关闭预测小测" class="lab-close" @click="a.quiz(false)"/></div><p>{{m.current.question}}</p><div class="choices"><Button v-for="(choice,i) in m.current.choices" :key="i" :aria-pressed="m.answer===i" @click="a.answer(i)">{{'ABC'[i]}} · {{choice}}</Button></div><p class="feedback" role="status">{{m.feedback}}</p></section><Button v-else @click="a.quiz(true)">展开预测小测</Button></aside></div></section></div><footer>每一次调整，都是一次有依据的猜想。</footer>
 </template><template v-else>
  <nav><Button tag="a" :href="m.backHref" icon="arrow-left" aria-label="返回课堂">返回课堂</Button><div class="lab-actions"><Button v-if="!geometry" @click="a.fullscreen">全屏</Button><Button @click="about=true">说明</Button></div></nav>
  <header class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">从条件出发，让每一步有依据</p><h1>模型推导<span>Geometry, step by step.</span></h1><p>41 个模型 · 7 类方法 · SVG 分步推演 · 应用题与单元知识</p></div><div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">△<span>∠</span></div></header><p class="source-note">依据《初中几何模型汇总》8 页资料整理，保留原编号（原资料缺少编号 30）。主图可播放或逐步推演；变式另附条件与推导。坐标图仅作示意，文字证明才是依据。</p>
  <p v-if="error" role="alert">{{error}}</p>
  <section v-if="geometry" class="lab-filters"><Field :model-value="m.filters.search" type="search" label="搜索模型" placeholder="名称、条件、结论或知识点" @update:model-value="v=>a.filter('search',v)"/><Button @click="open('group')">{{m.filters.group||'全部类别'}} ⌄</Button><Button @click="open('level')">{{m.filters.level==='advanced'?'含后续课程的拓展':m.filters.level==='core'?'八年级基础与综合':'全部模型'}} ⌄</Button><Button @click="a.random">随机研习</Button></section>
